WEBVTT

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:08.480
Don't shoot!

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.240
Please forgive him!

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:19.410
You're confined to the dorm until we decide how to proceed.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.160
Is that it?

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:29.360
You're not going to lock me up like Cayenne?

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:32.340
Or is this just more training?

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.940
Mikono Suzushiro.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.980
What have I done?

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:32.880
Mikono, do you remember what Jin said to us when we were buried?

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.210
Yeah?

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.380
When I heard it, I thought...

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:41.780
As long as I don't forget Jin, he'll always be with me.

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:47.640
I'll carry his memory with me and live as well as I can.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:53.160
Yunoha... I guess that training had a purpose after all.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:56.600
You're the one who made me realize that, Mikono.

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:02.260
You told me that I was precious to you.

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:07.180
So now, in return, I'm going to support you.

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:11.370
You're precious to me, too, Mikono.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.080
Yunoha...

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:16.770
Thank you.

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:19.960
Mikono...

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:21.260
Hey, it ended well, didn't it?

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.640
Though, you didn't do anything...

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:29.140
Why did I do that? I don't know.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.500
I don't even understand myself anymore.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:37.500
That's okay. No one really understands themselves completely.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:42.200
But I feel like I don't understand anything.

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:44.440
And that...

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.520
Are you saying Mikono is Silvie?

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:55.080
Yes. And that guy is Apollon.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.480
What's the matter?

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:00.840
It's nothing.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.720
Speaking of strange things...

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:09.000
Shush has never liked anyone but me,

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.060
but she really took a liking to him.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:15.780
So he can't be too bad.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:22.660
Whoa!

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:25.320
It's even worse with Amata.

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.950
Shush scratched his face.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:37.340
Now that I think about it, Shush has hated me ever since we met.

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:42.700
Does that mean I'm not meant to be with Mikono?

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:45.100
You could be right.

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:48.380
Maybe you're just not fated for one another.

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:51.720
Like how Mix and I were brought together by holes!

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:53.960
It's your destiny to be hated by Shush

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:57.800
and lose your love to that wolf guy.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:00.150
Is that what you're thinking?

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:10.220
<i>Was this all predestined 12,000 years ago?</i>

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:12.250
Don't get so down, Amata!

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:16.740
They say if you want to shoot down the captain, first aim for his horse.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.730
Try getting Shush to like you first.

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:25.260
That'll be 3,450 kowloons, please.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.550
Okay.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:34.060
Well, I bought stuff I think Shush will like,

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.650
but I don't think it'll help.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:58.330
There I go again.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.060
Go what?

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.710
Nothing!

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:05.210
Can I ask you something?

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:08.920
Let's say that I told someone something I shouldn't have.

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:11.200
How do I handle it?

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.430
Don't "handle" it.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:16.220
Skip the drama and just tell him.

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:18.240
That's better for him, too.

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:20.190
A-Are you sure?

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.740
No point being polite. Just say it!

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.800
"I don't like you!"

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:25.820
What?

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:29.030
When it comes to men, you have to be firm!

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:32.700
Oops! I'm supposed to meet Andy!

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:34.400
Bye!

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.540
"Bye"?

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.100
That doesn't help at all!

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:39.540
Damn it!

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:53.080
Area 337 again?

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.560
Get on it immediately.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:59.800
Obviously, rescuing civilians should be your top priority.

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:00.810
Roger.

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:05.730
<i>Ianthe was created by my mother, Oriza.</i>

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:10.940
<i>It maintained order and gave prosperity to this world.</i>

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:16.800
<i>But it's suffering a mysterious drop in power.</i>

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:19.000
<i>Its control systems are failing.</i>

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.330
<i>There have even been explosions.</i>

00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:27.650
<i>I know that no machine can last forever.</i>

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:30.750
<i>But this is still too quick.</i>

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:33.260
<i>Jin...</i>

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:37.970
<i>Is this the beginning of the end for Altair?</i>

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:43.000
<i>Or is it my punishment?</i>

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:47.730
A practice duel?

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.980
Yes. It was Fudo's suggestion.

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:54.490
Making the Aquarions fight each other is too dangerous!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:58.490
Life and death are two sides of the same coin.

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:02.460
They have completed the Special Training of the Grave.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:05.080
They will learn from danger and reach the next level of their potential.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:08.250
The battles are only going to get worse.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:12.300
They must be able to overcome greater challenges.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:18.260
That's why they must go through this special training.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:20.440
Roger.

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:22.770
Which Elements will participate?

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:25.770
They've already been decided.

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:28.020
Cayenne Suzushiro.

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:31.530
Never thought I'd fight a mock battle with another Aquarion.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.530
Sazanka Bianca.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.460
I'm gonna Unite with Cayenne!

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.740
I hope the other pilot is Shrade!

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:39.740
Malloy Dorezza.

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:42.120
Sorry, it's just me.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:46.920
Against Amata, Zessica, and Mikono.

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:51.170
<i>Is everything just predestined?</i>

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:52.920
<i>How could that be?</i>

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:01.770
All Vectors have entered the battlefield.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.770
Cayenne's team will form Aquarion Gepard!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:05.770
Roger!

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:08.610
Amata's team will form Aquarion Evol!

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:09.610
Roger!

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:15.990
Training Union!

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.700
Go! Aquarion!

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:29.550
Aquarion Gepard!

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:34.340
Aquarion Evol!

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:43.310
There are no restrictions on Element powers for either team!

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.460
Treat your opponent as a real enemy!

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:47.560
Fight with all you've got!

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:52.720
Amata, do you have what it takes to protect Mikono?

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:54.820
Show me what you've got!

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:03.920
Amata!

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:05.840
They've got a range advantage on us!

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:07.790
We'll close in using the buildings as cover!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.920
Crumble...

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:22.880
How?

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:24.680
That building fell apart like a sand castle!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:29.050
That's my Element power. It got an upgrade from the Special Training of the Grave.

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:32.060
This is the first time I've really been able to use it!

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.520
The Curse of Malloy.

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:39.950
It destroys the stability of any material,

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:43.600
making it shatter at even the slightest impact.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.370
Unfortunately for you,

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:51.240
there's nothing you can use for cover!

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:58.510
Go, Mikono!

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:08.890
Amata! Let's get away!

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:11.270
That's exactly what Gepard wants us to do!

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.220
If we can just get over there...

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:16.680
Amata, we can't win if we keep running away!

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:19.800
He knows that! But just for now-

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:21.500
Both of you, stop talking!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.900
Gepard excels at ranged combat.

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:32.080
They're not going to chase us down.

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:34.420
Amata!

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.600
Amata, behind you!

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:42.090
Wrong again, Amata!

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:47.470
Digging holes is trivial when you add my curse to gunfire!

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:51.980
Damn it, Malloy! You know holes are my thing!

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.480
Infinity Punch!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.880
The machine's balance is off!

00:11:57.880 --> 00:11:58.980
Look!

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.490
Evol's feet!

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:01.900
They're rusting!

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:06.410
My Element power is corrosion!

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:12.940
I can make any material rot away!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:17.920
This is over!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:22.170
Infinity Punch!

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:32.140
Keep running away. That works great for Gepard.

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:37.710
The rusting stopped, but we won't be able to close in like this.

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.400
Give up already, Amata!

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:43.400
You never had a chance of winning this mock battle.

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:46.500
This was your fate from the start.

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:47.830
My fate?

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:49.800
Just accept your defeat.

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.960
What?

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:02.380
Is he predicting my moves?

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:04.720
Well, Amata?

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:08.800
If these were real bullets, your Evol would be swiss cheese by now.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:10.850
It's Cayenne's Prophecy of Despair!

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:17.350
It's been enhanced so that he can see a moment into the future!

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:21.860
Thanks to the Special Training of the Grave, their base aura levels have also increased.

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:26.860
Combining Cayenne's Instant Prophecy with Gepard's weapon targeting...

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:30.120
He can aim his fire right where the enemy is about to move!

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:32.120
Seriously?

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:36.120
<i>Jin, please protect Mikono and the others...</i>

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.130
Where are you going to come from?

00:13:40.010 --> 00:13:43.560
Right? Left? Maybe from above?

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:45.130
Wherever it is, I'll read it...

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:48.540
and predict the defeat you're destined to suffer!

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:52.080
No.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.020
I refuse to lose to fate.

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:56.640
I won't take it!

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:59.060
Amata!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:04.000
Even if it was predestined 12,000 years ago...

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:06.150
I... I...

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:08.530
I'll fight fate for it!

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:12.290
Amata, you're right.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:14.330
Zessica?

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:18.810
The vision in the mirror I told you about...

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:20.860
I thought it was fate.

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:23.880
But I forgot that there was something more important.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:27.480
Fate's not what matters.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:32.140
It's our truth, right here and now!

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.140
What we're feeling this instant!

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:37.360
<i>Skip the drama and just tell him!</i>

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:42.190
I think I can say it!

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:45.680
Say what, Zessica?

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:50.140
Amata...

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:51.070
Yes?

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:55.830
I... I lo...

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.120
Looks like they're done fighting.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:04.080
Then let's put them out of their misery!

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:09.880
Fire!

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:20.310
I lo...

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:24.610
I love you!

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.840
That was close.

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:32.020
What did you say, Zessica?

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:35.530
I couldn't hear you over the explosions.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.500
What?

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:39.040
It's really important to you, right?

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:40.450
Say it again.

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:42.320
I'm listening now!

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.080
I...

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:53.300
love...

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:55.800
you.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:02.560
I love you, Amata!

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:08.230
L...

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:15.950
Love?

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:25.940
Love!

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:28.430
I...

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:29.590
I said it!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.000
Z-Zessica?

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:37.680
What's going on?

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:38.680
The Evol!

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:39.640
It's glowing!

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:52.240
Evol's emotional gauge is going way up!

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:53.840
That's...

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:55.570
Zessica's strong unrequited love!

00:16:56.070 --> 00:17:02.900
So Aquarion can go berserk for not just mutual love, but unrequited love, too!

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:06.100
What should I say?

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:08.040
I'm flattered, but...

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.340
Amata!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.260
Evol's moving on its own!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:36.820
The Infinity Punch!

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:37.530
It vanished into thin air!

00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:39.800
Fudo, what's going on?

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.030
It's begun.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:48.780
When they take the final step into forbidden love,

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:52.820
the power that Aquarion unleashes will cross time and space.

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:56.520
Love goes out of control.

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:03.310
What is this?

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:07.560
Images are coming in through the punch!

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:10.420
I've never seen this place before!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:11.570
Where is it?

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:14.650
Who's that?

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:16.240
He's like an animal!

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:29.880
Are those two...

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:33.520
That's Aquarion!

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:37.180
But it's a little different from our Aquarion.

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.090
This is...

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.800
Genesis Union!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.340
High Commander Fudo?

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:46.500
He kind of looks like him, but...

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:53.940
How beautiful.

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:58.780
The light of my beloved Wings of the Sun.

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:02.740
The light of hope that will restore us!

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:06.140
That man...

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:08.210
I've seen him somewhere...

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:10.960
But I can't remember where.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.560
Aquarion!

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:16.560
It's growing wings!

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:18.220
Wait, is that...

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.920
the legendary Aquarion?

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:26.400
Apollo!

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:28.310
Thank you, Silvia.

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:29.320
Apollo?

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:30.680
Silvia?

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:32.310
Not Silvie?

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:37.480
I'll never forget how lovely you smell.

00:19:38.770 --> 00:19:39.950
Apollo!

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:45.240
Let's meet again.

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:48.320
In 12,000 years.

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:52.420
Apollo!

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:06.220
Is this...

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:07.600
Could it be...

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:11.200
The true story of what happened 12,000 years ago!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:16.650
What?

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:35.480
What happened?

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:36.670
How is the island?

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.360
The signal's clearing up!

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:39.420
We're getting video!

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:44.930
Are you serious?

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:49.350
The island's almost gone!

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.430
We've confirmed signs of all the Elements!

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:54.800
Gepard and Evol are intact!

00:20:56.850 --> 00:21:00.480
A heart that searches for the truth.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:03.890
And a heart that searches for true love.

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:07.060
The two have become one in harmony,

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:10.140
and the forbidden power has been awakened.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:16.940
Help! Someone get me out of here!

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:21.680
The Infinity Punch flew through time itself.

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:25.230
That's not all.

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:28.320
I couldn't predict it with my Instant Prophecy.

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:33.730
Could it have traveled through time itself?

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:38.880
Just how powerful is Aquarion?

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:43.680
Good, Cayenne's team is okay!

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:46.180
But what did we do?

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:48.740
It was my fault.

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:52.460
I'm the one who came out and said I loved you.

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:54.600
That's why the forbidden power awakened

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:56.750
and Evol went out of control.

00:21:57.410 --> 00:22:01.500
If I'd messed up, I could have killed everybody.

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:09.760
But that guy we saw...

